{"seq":3,"slug":"rasterization-fragment","title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/rasterization-fragment","wordCount":2165,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"光栅化与片段处理\">光栅化与片段处理</h1><p>光栅化阶段将连续的几何图元（三角形）离散化为帧缓冲上的片段（Fragment），随后片段着色器为每个片段计算最终颜色，Output Merger 执行深度测试与混合写入。这两个阶段决定了屏幕上每个像素的最终呈现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>边缘函数覆盖测试</strong>：现代 GPU 使用三条边的线性函数同时判定像素是否在三角形内，支持 Tile 级和 Quad 级的并行评估</li>\n<li><strong>Early-Z 优化</strong>：在片段着色器之前执行深度测试，避免对不可见像素执行昂贵的着色计算，但 discard/深度写入会使其失效</li>\n<li><strong>2x2 Quad 最小粒度</strong>：硬件以 Quad 为单位执行片段着色器以支持导数计算，细小三角形因此产生 Overshading 浪费</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"光栅化原理\">光栅化原理</h2><p>光栅化的核心任务是确定每个三角形覆盖了屏幕上的哪些像素。GPU 使用基于 Tile 的扫描或逐像素边缘函数测试来判定覆盖关系。</p>\n<p>**边缘函数法（Edge Function）**是现代 GPU 光栅化器的主流实现。对于三角形的每条边定义一个线性函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(x,y) = (x - x_0)(y_1 - y_0) - (y - y_0)(x_1 - x_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当且仅当像素中心满足所有三条边的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E \\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，该像素被三角形覆盖。</p>\n<p>GPU 通常以 2x2 像素的 Quad 为最小处理单元。即使 Quad 中只有一个像素被三角形覆盖，所有四个像素的片段着色器都会执行——多余的结果被丢弃。这种设计是为了支持片段着色器中的导数计算（<code>dFdx</code>/<code>dFdy</code>），因为导数需要相邻像素的值差分。这也解释了为什么细小三角形（面积小于一个像素）会导致严重的 Quad Overshading 浪费。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[裁剪后三角形] --&gt; B[Tile 级粗粒度测试]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逐 Quad 细粒度覆盖测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D{Quad 内有覆盖像素?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| E[生成 Fragment]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| F[丢弃 Quad]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Early-Z 测试]&#10;    G --&gt;|Pass| H[Fragment Shader]&#10;    G --&gt;|Fail| I[丢弃 Fragment]\">graph TD\n    A[裁剪后三角形] --&gt; B[Tile 级粗粒度测试]\n    B --&gt; C[逐 Quad 细粒度覆盖测试]\n    C --&gt; D{Quad 内有覆盖像素?}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| E[生成 Fragment]\n    D --&gt;|No| F[丢弃 Quad]\n    E --&gt; G[Early-Z 测试]\n    G --&gt;|Pass| H[Fragment Shader]\n    G --&gt;|Fail| I[丢弃 Fragment]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>光栅化参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fill Mode</td>\n<td>填充/线框/点</td>\n<td>调试用途</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cull Mode</td>\n<td>正面/背面/无剔除</td>\n<td>减少 50% 片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Front Face</td>\n<td>CW/CCW 定义正面</td>\n<td>与建模工具协调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depth Bias</td>\n<td>深度偏移</td>\n<td>解决 Shadow Acne</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conservative Raster</td>\n<td>保守光栅化</td>\n<td>保证覆盖任何部分的像素都被处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"片段着色器执行模型\">片段着色器执行模型</h2><p>片段着色器（Fragment Shader / Pixel Shader）对每个通过光栅化的片段独立执行。它接收从顶点阶段传来的插值属性（位置、法线、UV 等），输出一个或多个颜色值和可选的深度值。</p>\n<p>插值是透视正确的：硬件在三角形的三个顶点属性之间进行重心坐标插值，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 修正透视变形。插值模式可通过 Shader 关键字控制（<code>flat</code> 关闭插值、<code>noperspective</code> 使用线性插值）。</p>\n<p>片段着色器是管线中计算密度最高的阶段。在 1080p 分辨率下，每帧可能执行超过 200 万次片段着色器调用（不计 Overdraw）。典型的片段着色器工作包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>纹理采样与过滤（各向异性过滤消耗带宽）</li>\n<li>法线贴图解码与切线空间变换</li>\n<li>PBR 光照模型计算（多光源循环）</li>\n<li>阴影贴图采样与 PCF 过滤</li>\n<li>雾效/大气散射计算</li>\n</ul>\n<p>现代 GPU 使用 Wave/Warp 粒度执行片段着色器。同一个 Wave 内的线程共享指令流但操作不同数据（SIMT）。当 Wave 内出现分支（如 <code>if</code> 语句），两个分支都会执行，不满足条件的线程被 Mask 掉——这就是分支发散（Branch Divergence）的性能代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"early-z-与深度测试\">Early-Z 与深度测试</h2><p>深度测试决定哪些片段最终可见。标准的 Z-Test 发生在 Output Merger 阶段，但现代 GPU 支持 <strong>Early-Z</strong> 优化——在片段着色器执行之前就进行深度测试，通过测试的片段才进入着色器计算。</p>\n<p>Early-Z 生效条件（满足任一即失效）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>片段着色器写入深度</td>\n<td>编译器无法确定最终深度值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 discard/clip</td>\n<td>可能丢弃通过深度测试的片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开启 Alpha-to-Coverage</td>\n<td>影响覆盖决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UAV 写入（某些硬件）</td>\n<td>副作用要求完整执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>为最大化 Early-Z 收益，常见策略是先执行一遍 Depth Pre-pass（Z-Prepass）：仅写入深度不执行着色，建立完整的深度缓冲。主渲染 Pass 中 Early-Z 就能高效拒绝被遮挡的片段。这以一次额外的几何遍历（顶点处理成本）换取大量被拒绝的昂贵片段着色器调用。</p>\n<p><strong>Hierarchical-Z（Hi-Z）</strong> 进一步优化：GPU 维护深度缓冲的 mipmap，在 Tile 级别进行粗粒度剔除。如果整个 Tile 的最大深度仍小于当前三角形的最小深度，整个 Tile 的所有片段直接跳过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"output-merger-与混合\">Output Merger 与混合</h2><p>Output Merger（OM）是管线的最后一个固定功能阶段，负责将片段着色器的输出与帧缓冲中已有内容合并。它执行三个主要操作：</p>\n<p><strong>深度/模板测试</strong>：比较片段深度与深度缓冲中的值，决定是否写入。模板测试（Stencil Test）额外提供一个 8 位掩码，用于实现轮廓线、Portal 渲染等特殊效果。</p>\n<p><strong>混合（Blending）</strong>：对半透明物体执行。标准 Alpha 混合公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{final} = \\alpha_{src} \\times C_{src} + (1 - \\alpha_{src}) \\times C_{dst}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">sr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>混合要求半透明物体按从后到前的顺序渲染（画家算法），这打破了 Early-Z 的优化前提。Order-Independent Transparency（OIT）算法尝试解决排序问题，但各有性能代价。</p>\n<p><strong>写入掩码（Write Mask）</strong>：控制哪些颜色通道和深度值实际写入帧缓冲。可用于选择性更新（如只写入 Alpha 通道做遮罩预处理）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Fragment Shader 输出] --&gt; B[Scissor Test]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Stencil Test]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Depth Test]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Blending]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Write Mask]&#10;    F --&gt; G[帧缓冲写入]\">graph LR\n    A[Fragment Shader 输出] --&gt; B[Scissor Test]\n    B --&gt; C[Stencil Test]\n    C --&gt; D[Depth Test]\n    D --&gt; E[Blending]\n    E --&gt; F[Write Mask]\n    F --&gt; G[帧缓冲写入]</pre><h2 id=\"多采样抗锯齿\">多采样抗锯齿</h2><p>光栅化本质上是一个采样过程——以像素中心点判断覆盖关系会在三角形边缘产生锯齿。多采样抗锯齿（MSAA）通过在每个像素内取多个采样点来平滑边缘。</p>\n<p>MSAA 的关键特性：<strong>覆盖测试</strong>在所有采样点上执行，但<strong>片段着色器只执行一次</strong>（在像素中心或被覆盖的采样点重心）。着色器结果被复制到所有通过覆盖测试的采样点。最终通过 Resolve 操作对所有采样点取平均得到最终颜色。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抗锯齿方案</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>显存开销</th>\n<th>着色器开销</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MSAA 2x</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>2x</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSAA 4x</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>4x</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSAA 8x</td>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>8x</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>高质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSAA</td>\n<td>超采样</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>Nx</td>\n<td>最佳但极贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TAA</td>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>~1x+历史帧</td>\n<td>1x+后处理Pass</td>\n<td>主流方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DLAA/FSR</td>\n<td>AI/算法</td>\n<td>~1x</td>\n<td>额外 Pass</td>\n<td>最新趋势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MSAA 对几何边缘锯齿效果优异，但无法处理着色器内部的高频闪烁（如镜面高光 aliasing）。TAA（Temporal AA）通过在连续帧之间抖动采样点并融合历史数据来解决这两类问题，已成为 2024-2026 年间主流引擎的默认抗锯齿方案。NVIDIA DLSS 和 AMD FSR 在 TAA 基础上引入 AI 超分辨率，进一步提升了画质与性能的平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"render-target-与多目标输出\">Render Target 与多目标输出</h2><p>现代管线支持多渲染目标（Multiple Render Targets, MRT），允许片段着色器在一次 Pass 中同时输出到多个颜色附件。这是延迟渲染（见本 hub 渲染技术章节）的基础——几何 Pass 一次性输出 Albedo、Normal、Roughness/Metallic 到不同的 G-Buffer 纹理。</p>\n<p>MRT 的硬件限制通常为 8 个同时绑定的颜色附件加一个深度/模板附件。每个附件可以有独立的格式（R8G8B8A8、R16G16B16A16F 等）和混合设置。</p>\n<p>Render Pass 的概念在 Vulkan 中被显式化：<code>VkRenderPass</code> 定义了一组附件、子通道（Subpass）和它们之间的依赖关系。Subpass 机制允许在 Tile-Based GPU（移动端）上实现高效的片上数据传递——后续 Subpass 可以直接读取前一 Subpass 的输出而无需经过外部内存，这对移动端的带宽受限架构意义重大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>光栅化与片段处理是管线中像素产出的核心环节。边缘函数法实现高效覆盖测试，Early-Z 和 Hi-Z 通过提前拒绝不可见片段大幅减少无效着色。Output Merger 完成最终的深度/模板测试与混合写入。MSAA 和 TAA 分别从空间和时间维度解决采样不足导致的锯齿问题。MRT 机制为延迟渲染和 Visibility Buffer 方案提供了硬件基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"vertex-geometry-processing\">顶点与几何处理</a> 覆盖光栅化的前置阶段；<a href=\"../rendering-techniques/forward-vs-deferred\">前向与延迟渲染对比</a> 解释 MRT 在延迟渲染中的具体应用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光栅化与片段处理","id":"光栅化与片段处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"光栅化原理","id":"光栅化原理"},{"level":2,"text":"片段着色器执行模型","id":"片段着色器执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Early-Z 与深度测试","id":"early-z-与深度测试"},{"level":2,"text":"Output Merger 与混合","id":"output-merger-与混合"},{"level":2,"text":"多采样抗锯齿","id":"多采样抗锯齿"},{"level":2,"text":"Render Target 与多目标输出","id":"render-target-与多目标输出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"顶点与几何处理阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/vertex-geometry-processing"},"next":{"title":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/forward-vs-deferred"}}